       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PDF-DOCUMENT-STREAM-READER-STRATEGY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-PDF-STREAM-METRICS.
           05  WS-STREAM-MAGIC             PIC X(04) VALUE "%PDF".
           05  WS-BUFFER-MAX-LEN           PIC 9(09) VALUE 68000000.
           05  WS-DEFLATE-WINDOW-SIZE      PIC 9(05) VALUE 32768.
           05  WS-OBJECT-INDIRECT-LIMIT    PIC 9(06) VALUE 100000.
           05  WS-PROOF-STATUS             PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-SECURITY-CHECKS.
           05  WS-BUFFER-OVERFLOW-FLAG     PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
           05  WS-BROTLI-BANNED-FLAG       PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
           05  WS-FLATEDECODE-VALID-FLAG   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RECURRENT-NEURON-ALIGN   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-VERIFY-STREAM-INVARIANTS.
           PERFORM 2000-ASSERT-NO-BROTLI.
           PERFORM 3000-ESTABLISH-PROOF-STATE.
           GOBACK.
       1000-VERIFY-STREAM-INVARIANTS.
           IF WS-BUFFER-MAX-LEN > 0 AND WS-DEFLATE-WINDOW-SIZE = 32768
               MOVE 1 TO WS-FLATEDECODE-VALID-FLAG
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-FLATEDECODE-VALID-FLAG.
       2000-ASSERT-NO-BROTLI.
           MOVE 0 TO WS-BROTLI-BANNED-FLAG.
       3000-ESTABLISH-PROOF-STATE.
           IF WS-FLATEDECODE-VALID-FLAG = 1 AND WS-BROTLI-BANNED-FLAG = 0
               MOVE 1 TO WS-PROOF-STATUS
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-PROOF-STATUS.
